{"name":"Static","hex":"#d5d3c3","fetched":"2026-10-16","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"static","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Unchanging; that cannot or does not change.","Making no progress; stalled, without movement or advancement."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Interference on a broadcast signal caused by atmospheric disturbances; heard as crackles on radio, or seen as random specks on television.","Interference or obstruction from people."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/static"}],"entries":[{"title":"Static, Kentucky and Tennessee","blocks":[{"text":"Static is an unincorporated community in Clinton County, Kentucky, and Pickett County, Tennessee, in the southeastern United States. It is located on the Tennessee–Kentucky state line south of Albany, Kentucky, and north of Byrdstown, Tennessee."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c0/Static-tn-ky-crossroads-tnky1.jpg/330px-Static-tn-ky-crossroads-tnky1.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Static%2C_Kentucky_and_Tennessee"},{"title":"Static (DC Comics)","blocks":[{"text":"Static is a superhero appearing in American comic books published by DC Comics. The character was created by Milestone Comics founders Dwayne McDuffie, Denys Cowan, Michael Davis, Derek T. Dingle, and Christopher Priest. The character first appeared in a 3-page preview in Icon #1 with his first full appearance in Static #1, written by McDuffie and Robert L. Washington III and illustrated by John Paul Leon. He is a member of a fictional subspecies of humans with superhuman abilities known as metahumans. Not born with his powers, Hawkins' abilities develop after an incident exposes him to a radioactive chemical called \"Quantum Juice\", turning him into a \"Bang Baby\"."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/d/de/Static_%28Virgil_Hawkins%29.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Static_(DC_Comics)"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c0/Static-tn-ky-crossroads-tnky1.jpg/500px-Static-tn-ky-crossroads-tnky1.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c0/Static-tn-ky-crossroads-tnky1.jpg/1280px-Static-tn-ky-crossroads-tnky1.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c0/Static-tn-ky-crossroads-tnky1.jpg/500px-Static-tn-ky-crossroads-tnky1.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AStatic-tn-ky-crossroads-tnky1.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/d/de/Static_%28Virgil_Hawkins%29.png/250px-Static_%28Virgil_Hawkins%29.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/d/de/Static_%28Virgil_Hawkins%29.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/d/de/Static_%28Virgil_Hawkins%29.png/250px-Static_%28Virgil_Hawkins%29.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AStatic_(Virgil_Hawkins).png"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/d/d3/Static_vol._1_1_Milestone_Comics.jpg/250px-Static_vol._1_1_Milestone_Comics.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/d/d3/Static_vol._1_1_Milestone_Comics.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/d/d3/Static_vol._1_1_Milestone_Comics.jpg/250px-Static_vol._1_1_Milestone_Comics.jpg?utm_